+- TLC elapsed: 8 min 30 s (510 s)
+
+## File-boundary unit results
+
+Successful final modular run:
+
+- workflow: \`TLA Slot Core Modular Experiment\`
+- run: \`36967192135\`
+- tested commit: \`f025673fedb341e816ccad288f74839d28cb3099\`
